    var ok='[SAY:Daeris]"A." she says. "B." [SAY:Morwen]"C." she says. "D." [SAY:Frizwick]"E." she says. "F." [SAY:Ammut]"G." he says. "H." [SAY:Shalelu]"I." she says. "J." [SAY:Hemlock]"K." he says. "L."';
